<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="text-align: center;"><b style=""><font style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);" size="4" color="#ff0000">** FN Shipment ATA or ATD **</font></b></div>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Estimad@ Equipo este Shipment&nbsp; cuenta con datos ATD o ATA mayor que sus ETD y ETA.</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><u>Detalles:</u></div><div><br></div></div><div style=""><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Shipment:&nbsp;<b>{!Shipment__c.Number__c}</b></div></div></div><div style=""><font face="arial"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Estatus:&nbsp;</span></font><font color="#006600" face="arial"><b>{!Shipment__c.Shipment_Status__c}</b></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Cliente:&nbsp;</span><b style="font-size: 12pt;">{!Account.Name}</b></div></div><div style=""><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">Route:&nbsp;<b>{!Customer_Quote__c.Site_of_Load__c} -&nbsp;{!Customer_Quote__c.Site_of_Discharge__c}</b></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">ATD:<b>{!Shipment__c.ATA__c}</b>&nbsp; //&nbsp; Etd:{!Shipment__c.ETD_from_Point_of_Load__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;">ATA:&nbsp;<b>{!Shipment__c.ATD__c}</b>&nbsp; //&nbsp; Eta:&nbsp;{!Shipment__c.ETA_Point_of_Discharge__c}</div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style=""><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><b>Comentarios:</b>&nbsp;</font><font face="arial">{!Shipment__c.Status_Observations__c}</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: medium;">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial" style=""><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div></div>]]></td>
</tr>
